: "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-027", "label": "Study family SF-APPS-027: Adaptation quality vs talent as predictor of series wins", "score": 0.851, "reached_via": ["request matches RQC:RQC-082 (0.74); FAM:SF-APPS-027 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-082", "FAM:SF-APPS-030 auto_related_family (record_link_related_to) FAM:SF-APPS-027"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Adaptation quality vs talent as predictor of series wins", "auto_outcome_status": "untestable", "observed_hypothesis": "pct_ran_BEST - pct_ran_AVOID predicts series wins after controlling for RS net-rating talent.", "observed_result": "corr(talent, adapt)=+0.124. Per-series logistic: talent_diff_z +0.737 p=0.0213; adapt_diff_z +0.328 p=0.2755. Team-in-series cluster: talent p=0.0095, adapt p=0.2449. Univariate adapt beta=+0.311 p=0.1128. LPM: talent +0 [cut; read_family for the full text]", "auto_failure_mechanism": "A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)", "observed_failure_evidence": "After talent control adapt p=0.275; n~55 series cannot separate coaching adaptation from roster quality.", "observed_sample_and_power": "n=55 series / 110 directions"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:confounding"}, {"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:small_sample"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:CONFOUNDING"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-048", "label": "Study family SF-APPA-048: Player-level BEST vs AVOID H2 PPP gaps (exploratory)", "score": 0.78, "reached_via": ["request matches the question or hypothesis of FAM:SF-APPA-048 (0.78)"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Player-level BEST vs AVOID H2 PPP gaps (exploratory)", "auto_outcome_status": "not a hypothesis test", "observed_hypothesis": "Players score more on BEST-ranked counters than AVOID-ranked counters in the 55-series