 ],
 "historical_evidence": [
  {
   "id": "FAM:SF-APPS-030",
   "status_as_recorded": "untestable",
   "finding": "Recorded hypothesis: teams that run BEST counters more (and AVOID less) after suppression win more series. Result: BEST run rate vs won Spearman rho=+0.131 (p=0.1723); AVOID vs won rho=-0.098 (p=0.3099); mean PPP BEST 1.395 vs AVOID 0.865. Failure type A_unanswerable; INSUFF_EVIDENCE is 91.5% of triggers; n=110 series-directions."
