   "status_as_recorded": "supported",
   "finding": "Player-level BEST vs AVOID PPP gap on initiator-filtered H2 possessions: mean gap +0.427 PPP (BEST 1.347, 38 players; AVOID 0.920, 94 players) at n>=10 per tier. Only 3 players clear n>=30 in both tiers. Recorded as positive, but the record is about per-player possession gaps, not series outcomes."
