   "status_as_recorded": "rejected",
   "finding": "Playoff adaptation-pair sustainability: 10/12 pairs CONSISTENT and within 0.10 PPP of non-pivot; two pairs with enough signal were PIVOT_LOSES (PNR->PULL_UP 1.069 vs 1.224, n_matchups=9; DRIVE->PULL_UP 1.101 vs 1.217, n=5). Recorded as an adequately powered null (B_powered_null), with pair n_matchups 5 to 44."
