  {
   "id": "FAM:SF-APPM-022",
   "status_as_recorded": "inconclusive",
   "finding": "Superstar suppression profiles: rank-1 suppressor 'varies meaningfully across players'; most rank-1 deltas were within 1 to 2 SE; no multiple-comparison control; an OTHER artifact was flagged in the document."
