  {
   "id": "FAM:SF-APPA-050",
   "status_as_recorded": "not a hypothesis test",
   "finding": "Superstar sequential suppression: PUTBACK is the top suppressor for 6+ stars in the recorded cells (e.g., D. Mitchell d=-0.294, n_after=95), but several cells have n_after of 32 to 95; no multiplicity correction; mechanism unclear; no validation recorded."
